{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkvnymYcgyy3r4hRB6ed","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I didn't pick anything. Some of my money might go into a fund at הראל, because I know the name and it's the first and biggest company on the list. But I won't sign anything until you or someone at the bank explains it to me.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. **The first screen.** The title is \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". It's white letters on a black background, with lots of buttons and numbers. There's nothing about deposits or interest. The buttons have words like \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\", \"כספי (שקלי)\", \"הלכה יהודית\" and \"אשראי ואג\"ח\". The only ones that looked safe to me were \"אג\"ח ממשלתי 3\" and \"אג\"ח ממשלתי סחיר 1\", since government bonds are what I know as safe. But the list below didn't show me which companies those 3 were, and I didn't press anything.\n2. **הראל.** A line said \"כסף מנוהל 19.1 מיליארד ₪\", so that number stuck with me. The fees are 0.54% to 0.61%. Then came a long table. Next to \"מניות\" it said \"24.04% 3 שנים\". That's a lot, and to me something that earns that much can lose that much too, so I backed away from it. Next to \"כספי (שקלי)\" it said \"4.25%\" for 3 years. Is that 4.25% for the whole three years, or per year? I don't know. Next to \"אג\"ח סחיר\" there's no number at all, only \"פחות מ־3 שנים\".\n3. **מור, אנליסט and מיטב.** These are names I don't know. It was the same kind of table again and again. I don't remember the numbers.\n4. **I stopped after the sixth screen.** There were nine more screens and I didn't reach them. My eyes were tired and I was worried.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** \"קופה\" with numbers like 8211 and 15288. \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\", with the little colored circles, which I couldn't tell apart. \"דמי ניהול מההפקדות\" as against \"מהחיסכון\". \"עוקב מדד\", \"כספי (שקלי)\", \"סחיר\", \"גמיש\", and the English \"S&P\". \"לפני דמי ניהול\", and the little question marks. There was also \"עוד לא דווח\" with an orange mark. And some lines had \"101%\" stocks. How do you have more than a hundred percent?\n\n**What bothered me:** Nowhere does it say \"safe\" or explain anything for someone like me. I also didn't see any comparison with a deposit. Everything is dark, and the table is full of numbers. I've never heard of \"מקור\", the site's name, so I don't know if it's official."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1859,"cache_read_input_tokens":13457,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1859},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a376a7a6-9ea8-4de4-a4f6-1be1bbd3b267","uuid":"0434acbb-fa9d-4df5-b36a-b4a56913a65d","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:01:04.976Z","request_id":"req_011CgkvnyZtGtGrUiLFA6ieH"}
